      "file": "src/pages/ProductsPage.jsx",
      "line": 29,
      "description": "The endpoint is a template string in the UI layer. This is the string you will grep for in three files next term."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/pages/ProductsPage.jsx",
      "line": 36,
      "description": "No AbortController, no cleanup. Every keystroke starts a request and nothing cancels it."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/pages/ProductsPage.jsx",
      "line": 40,
      "description": "finally() sets loading false for whichever request happens to finish. With two in flight, the last one to settle wins — including the stale one."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/pages/ProductsPage.jsx",
      "line": 55,
      "description": "Loading, error and empty are all rendered here. Copy this block to the next screen that fetches, and the one after."
